// WMI Persistence - Command Line Event Consumer | T1546.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_wmi_persistence_commandline_event_consumer.yml
DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\Windows\\System32\\wbem\\WmiPrvSE.exe" and FolderPath endswith "\\wbemcons.dll"
